# --- wallowa-earthquakes-map ---
# earthquakes.json is live data fetch_earthquakes.py regenerates every run,
# and the rendered map image is an output too -- neither is source, so
# don't track them.
wallowa-earthquakes-map/earthquakes.json
wallowa-earthquakes-map/wallowa_earthquakes*.png
# --- wallowa-geology-map ---
# earthquake.json is live data fetch_earthquake.py regenerates, and the
# rendered map image is an output -- neither is source.
wallowa-geology-map/earthquake.json
wallowa-geology-map/wallowa_geology*.png
# --- maps/ ---
# swatch sheet geology_classes_preview.py renders -- an output, not source.
maps/geology_classes_preview.png
# --- county-geology-map ---
# data/ is live data fetch_geology.py regenerates per county, and the
# rendered maps are outputs -- neither is source.
county-geology-map/data/
county-geology-map/*_geology.png
county-geology-map/series/
county-geology-map/legend_wording_preview.txt
county-geology-map/series_cvd/
